      "id": "D-009-R008",
      "text": "OWNER DECISION: the owner selects Option B (the '6-day verified path') for M0-T019 and authorizes a scoped, owner-authorized, auto-expiring FE-S9 exception. This supersedes, for the two named versions ONLY, the prior WAIT default (B-017) and the earlier owner DECLINE of age exceptions for M0-T019 (B-013). The owner's stated concern is age solely as npm-incident 'infection protection'.",
