      "id": "D-009-R009",
      "text": "Implement a scoped, owner-authorized, auto-expiring exception in the FE-S9 committed-lockfile release-age gate (apps/web/scripts/dependency_age_gate.mjs) that admits AT MOST the exact pins brace-expansion@1.1.18 and sharp@0.35.3, and only while the entry is unexpired. Matching is by exact name@version; a non-matching pin is never admitted under age.",
