      "text": "The exception auto-expires (age-only, consistent with D-009-R006's <=7-day auto-expiry): an expired or invalid entry is IGNORED and the gate reverts to the unchanged 7-day age requirement. Expiry is evaluated against the authoritative registry UTC clock (never the local/CI clock), so a tampered clock cannot extend an exception.",
